{
  "id": 8879779381447,
  "title": "Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 06",
  "handle": "pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-06",
  "body_html": "<p>Experience ultimate comfort and spooky style with the Jeminise Comforter Set. This 5-piece bedding set, featuring a captivating Halloween theme, is designed to provide exceptional softness and breathability for a peaceful night's sleep. Perfect for adding a festive and cozy touch to your bedroom, it's an ideal choice for all seasons.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Content Included:</strong> Comes with a comforter (68\" x 90\"), flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\"). Pillow inserts are not included.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish and exquisite patterns with a Halloween theme, adding a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Stitching:</strong> Comforter includes exquisite stitching that enhances durability and prevents filling from shifting or clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit:</strong> The deep-pocket fitted sheet is designed with an elastic band on all four sides to accommodate mattresses up to 14 inches thick, ensuring a secure fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons, offering comfort whether it's fall, summer, winter, or any time of year.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Elastic Band, Deep Pocket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fitted Sheet Depth</th>\n<td>14 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
